# The null literal's cell is the pointer cell of the place's value type (OWN-TYPE-CODE-BANDS, Codex
# OTCB-EXACT-NULL-TYPE-WITNESS-20261006-01): `@: int p 0` and `@@: int q 0` at the root, one depth and the next.  The
# row reads the retained graph through the arena: each declaration's LIT payload is a present pointer cell holding
# null, of the exact typed domain of the declared cell it initializes -- before the run and after it.  check
